        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-07T05:15:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it\u0027s feasible. chunks() is defined for slices, but there\u0027s no easy and efficient way to convert \u0026str into \u0026[char].\n\nI see the same questions at https://users.rust-lang.org/t/solved-how-to-split-string-into-multiple-sub-strings-with-given-length/10542\n\nI added an assert instead.",
      "parentUuid": "411529c0_6c3b88a6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 48,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 48,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "428a96f871b4dba8603d40c9c9be67e8aac7e56e",
